<span id="Properties"></span>
==Eigenschaften==

<span id="Data"></span>
===Daten===

{{Properties_Title|Base}}

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|Originals|LinkList|}}: A list of selected features. Will be ignored, if the {{PropertyData|Transform Mode}} property is set to {{value|Whole shape}}.
* {{PropertyData|Transform Mode|Enumeration|}}:
*: {{value|Features}} (default)
*: {{value|Whole shape}}.
</div>

{{Properties_Title|CircularPattern}}

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|Axis|LinkSub}}: The axis and center of the circular pattern..
* {{PropertyData|Radial Distance|Length}}: Default is {{value|50.0 mm}}. Distance between consecutive concentric circles.
* {{PropertyData|Tangential Distance|Length}}: Default is {{value|25.0 mm}}. Approximate distance between consecutive elements on the same circle.
* {{PropertyData|Number Circles|IntegerConstraint}}: Default is {{value|3}}. Number of concentric circles, including the original element.
* {{PropertyData|Symmetry|IntegerConstraint}}: Default is {{value|1}}. Number of symmetry divisions used to round each circle's element count.
</div>

{{Properties_Title|Part Design}}

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* {{PropertyData|Refine|Bool|}}: Default is {{value|True}}. Refine shape (clean up redundant edges) after operations.
* {{PropertyData|Fuzzy Tolerance|FloatConstraint|}}: Default is {{value|-1.0}}. Fuzzy tolerance:
*: If value > 0: use the value
*: If value = 0: leave default value
*: If value < 0: determine value
</div>

{{Properties_Title|Transformation}}

* {{PropertyData/de|Suppressed Indices|IntegerList}}: Indizes der Instanzen im Muster, die unterdrückt werden.


